WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:09.070
Open your till, find a car by its ticket or plate, take the payment and let it out.

2
00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:15.930
Parking shows the car park live: cars inside, free spaces and what happens at the gates.

3
00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:23.420
At the exit, cashiers work in the Booth. It is made for a tablet.

4
00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:29.070
First open your till, with the cash you start with in the drawer.

5
00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:33.580
Every payment you take goes into your till.

6
00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:39.870
Scan the ticket's code, tap the card, or type the plate.

7
00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:43.230
Find.

8
00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:51.460
The car, when it came in, how long it stayed and the price. Shop validations are already taken off.

9
00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:55.830
Choose how they pay: cash, card, wallet or InstaPay.

10
00:00:55.830 --> 00:01:01.180
Cash. The receipt can be printed or sent by message.

11
00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:05.960
Then open the barrier and close the visit.

12
00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:14.550
A lost ticket, or a guest of the mall? Those buttons are on the same screen, and every one is logged.
